2026-10-29T14:55:40.8180892Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-10-29T14:55:40.8181514Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-10-29T14:55:40.8181780Z 
2026-10-29T14:55:40.8182115Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
