2026-10-29T14:55:40.8184245Z 
2026-10-29T14:55:40.8184697Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [30001..30008])[0m and groups [34m(gid 30000)[0m
2026-10-29T14:55:40.8185137Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-10-29T14:55:40.8185490Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-10-29T14:55:40.8185764Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-10-29T14:55:40.8185888Z 
2026-10-29T14:55:40.8186071Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-10-29T14:55:40.8186273Z 
